ah/16.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/surah/16.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/surah/16.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/surah/16.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsir Surah An-Nahl — menurut Ibnu Taimiyah dan Ibnu al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Tafsir Surah An-Nahl — Makna al-Quran menerusi kata-kata Ibnu Taimiyah dan Ibnu al-Qayyim\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/ms/\">Laman utama</a> › Surah An-Nahl</nav><h1>Tafsir Surah An-Nahl — menurut Ibnu Taimiyah dan Ibnu al-Qayyim</h1><section><p>Ayat-ayat yang mempunyai huraian dalam surah ini:</p><div class=\"vl\"><a href=\"/ms/ayah/16-9.html\">9</a><a href=\"/ms/ayah/16-17.html\">17</a><a href=\"/ms/ayah/16-18.html\">18</a><a href=\"/ms/ayah/16-25.html\">25</a><a href=\"/ms/ayah/16-32.html\">32</a><a href=\"/ms/ayah/16-36.html\">36</a><a href=\"/ms/ayah/16-43.html\">43</a><a href=\"/ms/ayah/16-53.html\">53</a><a href=\"/ms/ayah/16-59.html\">59</a><a href=\"/ms/ayah/16-60.html\">60</a><a href=\"/ms/ayah/16-62.html\">62</a><a href=\"/ms/ayah/16-75.html\">75</a><a href=\"/ms/ayah/16-76.html\">76</a><a href=\"/ms/ayah/16-80.html\">80</a><a href=\"/ms/ayah/16-81.